1
00:00:00,373 --> 00:00:03,413
My Spidey sense tells me
this has something to do with Penny.

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:06,130
Look, do you wanna buy me out or not?

3
00:00:06,296 --> 00:00:10,136
I'll give you $100, which will make me
half-owner, and we'll put it on my balcony.

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:13,140
(Howard:)Screw his balcony.
I'll give you 120 and put it in my garage.

5
00:00:13,303 --> 00:00:16,763
- I paid $200 for my share.
- Everybody knows a time machine loses...

6
00:00:16,931 --> 00:00:20,021
(Raj:)...half its value the minute
you drive it off the lot.

7
00:00:20,393 --> 00:00:23,103
I'll go for 200.
That time machine stays right where it is.

8
00:00:23,271 --> 00:00:26,861
(Raj:)Three hundred. And I'll throw in my original
1979 Mattel Millennium Falcon...

9
00:00:27,025 --> 00:00:28,905
...with real light-speed sound effects.

10
00:00:29,068 --> 00:00:33,778
(Leonard:)No. No more toys or action figures
or props or replicas...

11
00:00:33,948 --> 00:00:37,328
(Leonard:)...or costumes or robots
or Darth Vader voice changers.

12
00:00:37,493 --> 00:00:39,413
(Leonard:)I'm getting rid of all of it.

13
00:00:39,579 --> 00:00:41,619
(Howard:)You can't do that.
Look what you've created.

14
00:00:41,789 --> 00:00:44,209
(Howard:)It's like Nerdvana.

15
00:00:46,878 --> 00:00:50,088
(Raj:)More importantly,
you have a Darth Vader voice changer?

16
00:00:51,716 --> 00:00:54,556
- Not for long.
- I call dibs on the Golden Age Flash.

17
00:00:54,719 --> 00:00:57,719
(Howard:)I need that to complete
my Justice Society of America collection.

18
00:00:57,889 --> 00:00:59,179
(Raj:)- I called dibs.
- You can't.

